d By:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><span class="wikiexternallink"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://xwiki.com/user/teo">Teo</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Milestones:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><span class="wikiexternallink"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://xwiki.com/milestone/1dot0rc">1.0-RC-1</a></span></td></tr></table></div><div class="col-md-4 col-xs-12"><table><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Start Date:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><p>10/10/2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Due Date:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><p>23/06/2024</p></td></tr><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Creation Date:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><p>10/10/2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Update Date:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><p>10/10/2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="work-item-property-name">Close Date:</td><td class="work-item-property-value"><p>10/10/2010</p></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="work-package-description"><div class="work-item-property-name">Description</div><p>This is some nice description</p></div></div>
